# Supported browser matrix for the Breadboard frontend.
#
# This drives two things:
#   - Babel polyfill injection (@vue/app preset -> @babel/preset-env, useBuiltIns: 'usage')
#   - autoprefixer (CSS vendor prefixes)
#
# It currently mirrors browserslist's built-in `defaults` query, which is what
# was resolving implicitly before this file existed -- so adding it changes no
# build output. With caniuse-lite pinned in pnpm-lock.yaml, the resolved version
# list is now reproducible across machines/CI.
#
# To reduce the injected polyfill set, narrow this to the real participant
# browser matrix (e.g. "last 2 Chrome versions, last 2 Firefox versions,
# last 2 Safari versions, not dead") and re-run the polyfill audit.
defaults
